From f02d91dd290d882800d1bc186bad2c757f27f201 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yang Tsao <yang@fydeos.io>
Date: Tue, 14 Apr 2026 16:06:40 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Add ARC Settings classes for fydroid-rt

Add 28 org.chromium.settings.* classes implementing ARC-specific
Settings customizations:

- FeatureFactoryImpl: overrides SearchFeatureProvider and
  SuggestionFeatureProvider with ARC-aware implementations
- ArcDevelopmentSettingsDashboardFragment: replaces stock dev options
  with ARC WM feature toggles (14 controllers for system properties
  like force_fullscreen, smooth_scroll, wayland logging, etc.)
- ArcAccessibilitySettings: removes unsupported accessibility entries
- SettingsBlackHoleActivity: redirects CrOS-handled settings intents
  to Chrome OS via ArcIntentHelper
- HiddenPreferenceController: hides individual preferences by key

Also adds required string resources, string arrays for list
preferences, manifest entries for the new activities, and updates
config_featureFactory to point to the ARC implementation.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: Ia30244b53a4fd704e1b997a06b4dfc1c42d45028
